OL,3,GNEWSARapist who told woman to 'forget
OL,4,Aabout it' jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rapist who told a woman to "just
OL,7,Fforget about it" after he finished
OL,8,Fattacking her has been jailed for nine
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FJack Crannage, 27, ignored his victim's
OL,12,Fpleas to stop as he forced himself upon
OL,13,Fher, Teesside Crown Court heard.
OL,15,FThe woman said the trauma of the rape
OL,16,Fwas made worse by Crannage's continual
OL,17,Flies, which resulted in her having to
OL,18,Fgive evidence at trial.
OL,20,FJurors found Crannage, from Hartlepool,
OL,21,Fguilty of rape after a three-day trial.
